"/&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style="height:3pt"&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:1.5pt 1pt 1.5pt 13pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Total utility plant at cost&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="2" style="border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:1.5pt 0 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;273&#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:1.5pt 1pt 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="2" style="border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:1.5pt 0 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;272&#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:1.5pt 1pt 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style="height:3pt"&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Accumulated depreciation and amortization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="2" style="padding:1.5pt 0 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;(68)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="padding:1.5pt 1pt 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="2" style="padding:1.5pt 0 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;(61)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="padding:1.5pt 1pt 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style="height:3pt"&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:1.5pt 1pt 1.5pt 7pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Total utility plant, net&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;padding:1.5pt 0 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;padding:1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;205&#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;padding:1.5pt 1pt 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;padding:1.5pt 0 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;padding:1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;211&#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;padding:1.5pt 1pt 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-right:18pt;text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-right:18pt;text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt;Note 4 &#8211; Commitments and Contingencies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt;Services agreements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;The Company has certain services agreements with affiliates. See &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Note 5 &#8211; Related Party Transactions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt; for information regarding such agreements. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt;Guarantees&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;The Company guarantees certain Calcasieu Pass project-level debt instruments that contain certain customary affirmative and negative covenants that, among other things, limit the Company's ability to incur additional indebtedness, create liens, dispose of assets, or pay dividends, distributions or other restricted payments. As of June 30, 2026, the Company has no liability recorded related to these guarantees.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt;Environmental and regulatory matters&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;The Company is subject to extensive regulation under federal, state and local statutes, rules, regulations and laws. These laws require that the Company engage in consultations with appropriate federal and state agencies and that we obtain and maintain applicable permits and other authorizations. Failure to comply with such laws could result in legal proceedings, which may include substantial penalties. The Company believes that, based on currently known information, compliance with these laws and regulations will not have a material adverse effect on our results of operations, financial condition or cash flows. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt;Legal proceedings &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;The Company may in the future be involved as a party to various legal proceedings, which are incidental to the ordinary course of business. The Company regularly analyzes current information and, as necessary, provide accruals for probable liabilities on the eventual disposition of these matters. In the opinion of management, as of June 30, 2026, there were no threatened or pending legal matters that would have a material impact on our results of operations, financial position or cash flows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-right:18pt;text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt;Note 5 &#8211; Related Party Transactions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Venture Global costs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;&#8211; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Venture Global and certain of its subsidiaries provide the Company with various forms of functional support including corporate services, and operations and maintenance services. The costs for this support are charged to the Company through various service agreements based on either a direct reimbursement model or fixed fee structure. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Transportation agreements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;&#8211; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Calcasieu Pass has interruptible and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ff0000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;firm transportation service agreements with the Company to secure capacity for the transportation of natural gas feedstock to the Calcasieu Pass terminal. The firm transportation service agreement commenced in April 2025, upon the start of full commercial operations at the Calcasieu Pass Terminal. Prior to April 2025, TransCameron provided interruptible service to the Calcasieu Pass Terminal. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000